message: "If you use ProkaPeak, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ProkaPeak"
abstract: >-
  ProkaPeak assigns transcription factor binding peaks from ChIP-seq, DAP-seq or
  similar assays in bacteria to the genes they likely regulate.
